{
 "comment": [
  "Our own dialogs and records (not the original's: no Blizzard text or art), which the runtime puts beside the",
  "original's (kp_ui_data.c): tools/defs_c.py compiles them as KBIN, KEXT and KLAB, each BIN by",
  "tools/research/scdata/formats/dialog.py build(). koprulu\\video.bin: the video options in place of",
  "rez\\video.bin (kp_ui_options.c): the gamma (ID 1), then radio groups by ID, the first of each Auto:",
  "the art 10..13, the fog 20..22, the water 30..32, the text 40..42, the portraits 50..52 (none, still,",
  "animated), the lighting 60..62 (Auto, off, on). koprulu\\language.bin: the languages (ADR 0016; a glue",
  "popup over pDPopup.pcx, kp_ui_menus.c): OK 1, Cancel 3, the text's label 4 and its button 5, the speech's",
  "label 6 and button 7 (a button's text is the language's own name, set at run time; a click takes the next",
  "language). \"extend\": records appended to an original's dialog after its own (their indices go on from its",
  "last): rez\\gluMain.bin's Language (ID 11), shown when there is more than one language to choose. Each",
  "widget: type (the original's control types), id, flags, rect [x, y, width, height] (the container's on the",
  "original's 640 x 480 screen, the others in it) and text (with flag 0x200 its first byte the hotkey,",
  "\\u0004..\\u0001 the hotkey's colour). \"labels\": texts we give an original's records that have none, by",
  "record index: rez\\gluMain.bin's version label (ID 10, kp_ui_menus.c's version_label: %s is the original's version",
  "in place of gluAll 3's \"%s\" of the remake's own). defs/l10n/koprulu-<locale>.json has a language's texts of them."
 ],
